      <guid>linux.do-topic-2360488</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 10 Jun 2026 02:49:06 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;港卡（中国大陆境外发行的银联卡）你好中国App有100-20优惠券。支付的时候用你好中国支付即可。&lt;br&gt;
京东买E卡和美团团购实测可用，这个-20%最高只能减20块。&lt;br&gt;
一户就只有一次机会。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/8/9/2/8922159a3a1405a3c9db8ce7142e58f017cb0343.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/jz8rdadR2r07xXJrfgVZpo7rQNZ.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;微信图片_20260610104745_25_513&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/9/2/8922159a3a1405a3c9db8ce7142e58f017cb0343_2_229x500.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;微信图片_20260610104745_25_513&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;jz8rdadR2r07xXJrfgVZpo7rQNZ&quot; width=&quot;229&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/9/2/8922159a3a1405a3c9db8ce7142e58f017cb0343_2_229x500.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/9/2/8922159a3a1405a3c9db8ce7142e58f017cb0343_2_343x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/9/2/8922159a3a1405a3c9db8ce7142e58f017cb0343_2_458x1000.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F2F6F2&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
